      <title>前英伟达工程师专捡闲置GPU，开发拾荒者调度系统降低算力门槛</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/%E5%89%8D%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BE%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%B8%88%E4%B8%93%E6%8D%A1%E9%97%B2%E7%BD%AEGPU%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E6%8B%BE%E8%8D%92%E8%80%85%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E9%97%A8%E6%A7%9B/</link>
